      </itemizedlist>
        <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Cosmic-session Dependencies</bridgehead>
          <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Required</bridgehead>
            <para>rustc, cargo-c, cosmic-applets, cosmic-app-library, cosmic-bg, cosmic-comp, cosmic-icons,
            cosmic-idle, cosmic-launcher, cosmic-notifications, cosmic-osd, cosmic-osk, cosmic-panel, cosmic-randr,
            cosmic-screenshot, cosmic-settings, cosmic-settings-daemon, cosmic-wallpapers, cosmic-workspaces,
            xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic, pop-fonts, noto-fonts, and xwayland</para>

    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-session</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-session for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">sed -i "s|DCONF_PROFILE=cosmic|DCONF_PROFILE=/usr/share/dconf/profile/cosmic|" data/start-cosmic &amp;&amp;
cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">export XDP_COSMIC="/usr/libexec/xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic" &amp;&amp;
cargo build --release</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-session /usr/bin/cosmic-session &amp;&amp;
install -vDm755 data/start-cosmic /usr/bin/ &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/cosmic-session.target /usr/lib/systemd/user/cosmic-session.target &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/cosmic.desktop /usr/share/wayland-sessions/cosmic.desktop &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/cosmic-mimeapps.list /usr/share/applications/cosmic-mimeapps.list &amp;&amp;
install -vDm644 debian/cosmic-session.gsettings-override \
  /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas/50_cosmic-session.gschema.override &amp;&amp;
install -vDm644 data/dconf/profile/cosmic /usr/share/dconf/profile/cosmic</userinput></screen>

        <screen><userinput remap="post">glib-compile-schemas /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

